  "Description": {
    "Cost": 17005268,
    "UIName": "Jotunn",
    "Id": "chassisdef_jotunn_JTN-Prime",
    "Name": "Jotunn",
    "Details": "The primary configuration of the Jotunn combines two Rotary Gauss Rifles providing massive Alpha strikes with two Large ER Pulse Lasers and two iATM-9 launchers as followup. While 19 double heat sinks try to cool the mech enough, in typical Clan fashion it is far from enough thus making it the weakpoint of the configuration.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.4</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
